      "slug": "smallest-phone-best-battery",
      "title": "The smallest phone of the year still has the best battery",
      "tags": [
        "quick",
        "reviews"
      ],
      "daysAgo": 1,
      "markdown": "It fits in a coin pocket and it lasted two full days in our testing. The trick is not a bigger cell; it is a screen that refuses to waste power on pixels nobody is looking at.\n\nShort news items like this one sit in the template's quick-hit rail. Replace it with your own.",
