      "daysAgo": 6,
      "markdown": "It parks like a hatchback and carries a sheet of plywood flat. The compromise is the ride: firm, honest and a little loud.\n\n## Verdict\n\nGood for people who need a bed twice a month and a parking space every day. Sample review copy.",
